{"id": 11751, "title": "The family of teachers", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "the-family-of-teachers", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/11751_the-family-of-teachers.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["广州市有一个中学的数学老师叫吴晖晖，她已经当老师29年了。她的爷爷是中国著名的教育家，她的爸爸、妈妈都是老师，一生都在做乡村教育。吴老师的其他家人中，有三十多人都在不同的城市做教育工作。她自己的女儿现在也在当老师。一家四代人都相信，教育是伟大的事业，这也是他们一生的追求。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["廣州市有一個中學的數學老師叫吳暉暉，她已經當老師29年了。她的爺爺是中國著名的教育家，她的爸爸、媽媽都是老師，一生都在做鄉村教育。吳老師的其他家人中，有三十多人都在不同的城市做教育工作。她自己的女兒現在也在當老師。一家四代人都相信，教育是偉大的事業，這也是他們一生的追求。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["Guǎng zhōu shì yǒu yī gè zhōng xué de shù xué lǎo shī jiào Wú Huī huī， tā yǐ jīng dāng lǎo shī 29 nián le。 tā de yé ye shì Zhōng guó zhù míng de jiào yù jiā， tā de bà ba、 mā ma dōu shì lǎo shī， yī shēng dōu zài zuò xiāng cūn jiào yù。 Wú lǎo shī de qí tā jiā rén zhōng， yǒu sān shí duō rén dōu zài bù tóng de chéng shì zuò jiào yù gōng zuò。 tā zì jǐ de nǚ ér xiàn zài yě zài dāng lǎo shī。 yī jiā sì dài rén dōu xiāng xìn， jiào yù shì wěi dà de shì yè， zhè yě shì tā men yī shēng de zhuī qiú。"], "english_paragraphs": ["There is a middle school mathematics teacher in Guangzhou named Wu Huihui. She has been a teacher for 29 years. Her grandfather is a famous educator in China, and her father and mother are both teachers and have been engaged in rural education all their lives. More than 30 other members of Teacher Wu’s family are working in education in different cities. Her own daughter is now a teacher. Four generations of the family believe that education is a great cause and it is also their lifelong pursuit."], "english_full": "There is a middle school mathematics teacher in Guangzhou named Wu Huihui. She has been a teacher for 29 years. Her grandfather is a famous educator in China, and her father and mother are both teachers and have been engaged in rural education all their lives. More than 30 other members of Teacher Wu’s family are working in education in different cities. Her own daughter is now a teacher. Four generations of the family believe that education is a great cause and it is also their lifelong pursuit.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Guǎng zhōu\" data-defn=\"Guangzhou; a major city in southern China, capital of Guangdong Province.\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">广州</span><span class=\"tr\">廣州</span><rt>Guǎng zhōu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shì\" data-defn=\"city / municipality (administrative unit)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">市</span><span class=\"tr\">市</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu\" data-defn=\"to have; there is\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhōng xué\" data-defn=\"middle school\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">中学</span><span class=\"tr\">中學</span><rt>zhōng xué</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shù xué\" data-defn=\"mathematics\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">数学</span><span class=\"tr\">數學</span><rt>shù xué</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lǎo shī\" data-defn=\"teacher\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">老师</span><span class=\"tr\">老師</span><rt>lǎo shī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiào\" data-defn=\"to be called\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">叫</span><span class=\"tr\">叫</span><rt>jiào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Wú Huī huī\" data-defn=\"A personal name, Wu Huihui\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">吴晖晖</span><span class=\"tr\">吳暉暉</span><rt>Wú Huī huī</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"she\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">她</span><span class=\"tr\">她</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǐ jīng\" data-defn=\"already\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">已经</span><span class=\"tr\">已經</span><rt>yǐ jīng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dāng\" data-defn=\"to be / to act as\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">当</span><span class=\"tr\">當</span><rt>dāng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lǎo shī\" data-defn=\"teacher\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">老师</span><span class=\"tr\">老師</span><rt>lǎo shī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">2</span><span class=\"tr\">2</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">9</span><span class=\"tr\">9</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nián\" data-defn=\"year\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">年</span><span class=\"tr\">年</span><rt>nián</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"le\" data-defn=\"(completed action marker) / (modal particle indicating change of state, situation now)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"she\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">她</span><span class=\"tr\">她</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" d